    <string name="reading_desc_gecmis_simdi_gelecek">A spread answering how things were in the past, how they are now and how they will be.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_durum_aksiyon_sonuc">A short spread showing the process and outcome of a situation.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_iliski">A basic spread showing the current state of your relationship across past, present and future.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_uyumluluk">How compatible are you really? A 7-card spread showing your emotional, mental and physical compatibility.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_detayli_iliski">A detailed spread covering heart, mind and action across past, present and future. Analyzes every dimension of the relationship with 9 cards.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_mucadeleler">A 7-card spread examining conflicts and difficulties in the relationship and suggesting solutions.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_tamam_mi_devam_mi">Should you fight for this relationship or let it go? Guidance with 6 cards.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_gelecege_giden_yol">You know the future you want — but how will you get there? A spread that draws your roadmap.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_is_problemleri">A spread examining the causes of the problems you face at work.</string>
    <string name="reading_desc_finansal_durum">A spread showing your financial situation and telling you what you need.</string>

